OL,3,GNEWSAJewish Londoners hope for change
OL,4,Aafter 'horrible' year
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a Friday morning at the Karma
OL,7,FBread Bakery in north London and Tami
OL,8,FIsaacs Pearce and her team are "mad
OL,9,Fbusy", rolling, kneading and braiding
OL,10,Fdough in preparation for the Jewish New
OL,11,FYear holiday of Rosh Hashanah.
OL,13,F"My bakers will be working around the
OL,14,Fclock for about four days," she says
OL,15,Fcheerfully, as yet another batch of
OL,16,Fchallah is carried to the oven.
OL,18,F"We fill it with apple and cinnamon for
OL,19,Fa sweet, abundant new year because
OL,20,Fthat's what we wish for.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
