OL,3,GNEWSAJewish Londoners hope for change
OL,4,Aafter 'horrible' year
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's really a time for family and for
OL,7,Four loved ones to come together, which
OL,8,Fis becoming more and more important to
OL,9,Fthe Jewish community every year at the
OL,10,Fmoment."
